## 安装

```sh
dsh plugin --profile web add github:173787247/dsh-wsl-pkg
# 或本机 path：
# dsh plugin --profile web add /mnt/c/Users/YOU/Desktop/AIFullStackDevelopment/dsh-wsl-pkg
